  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Accountancy Prog at the University of Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to upgrade the Accounting curriculum and education in Liberia through strengthening the capacity of the Accounting Department of the University of Liberia.  The overall expected outcome is improved accountancy education and training that will help improve transparency and accountability in both the private and public sectors through better financial reporting and oversight arrangements. This will also build trust and confidence in the accountancy profession by the public.</narrative>
  </description>
